Lume

Lume is derived from Hume Launcher, Copyright 2026 Petrobot, licensed under the Apache License 2.0.
The source has been modified: renamed and rebranded, new design, European content instead of Indian,
health and Wi-Fi panels, shared device profiles. Original licence and notices are kept below.

Part of the Recent Apps screen (src/org/lumesuite/launcher/RecentAppsOverlay.java) is adapted from
tvOS Launcher, Copyright 2026 techgenius, licensed under the Apache License 2.0
(https://github.com/techgenius1/tvOS-Launcher). Changes: renamed package, translations through It,
no bundled third-party app logos, background processes ended with KILL_BACKGROUND_PROCESSES instead of
on-device ADB (so it works on Fire OS), fewer disk writes on window changes.

